# Notices

## TarkovIRL — Weapons Handling Mod

TrueView was inspired by TarkovIRL, created by **adishee**.

- Original project: https://github.com/crm85/TarkovIRL-public
- Original mod page: https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1459/tarkovirl-weapons-handling-mod
- Author: adishee (https://github.com/crm85)

The ideas behind TrueView's weapon deadzone system and several weapon
handling concepts came from TarkovIRL. No TarkovIRL code is used: TrueView's
implementation is its own. Full credit for the original ideas goes to adishee.

